  },
  "22": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.34b.23",
   "sugya": "berakhot_34b_ayin_lo_raata",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support_deflection",
     "object": "defl_ryoch_amar_lecha",
     "gloss_en": "ורבי יוחנן אמר לך: מאי רחוק -- שהיה רחוק מדבר עבירה מעיקרא; ומאי קרוב -- שהיה קרוב לדבר עבירה ונתרחק ממנו השתא (= p_rachok_meikara, p_karov_venitrachek): the 'far' greeted first is the one who never sinned",
     "deflects": "s_shenemar_larachok_velakarov",
     "refuted": false
    },
    {
     "type": "proposition",
     "object": "p_rachok_meikara",
     "gloss_en": "what is 'far'? one who was far from a matter of transgression from the outset"
    }
   ]
  },
  "23": {
   "segId": "Berakhot.34b.24",
   "sugya": "berakhot_34b_ayin_lo_raata",
   "marks": [
    {
     "type": "support",
     "object": "s_shelo_shalta_ayin",
     "kind": "svara",
     "gloss_en": "זה עדן, שלא שלטה בו עין כל בריה -- Eden is 'what no eye has seen' because no creature's eye has ruled over it",
